        <p><b>Smil</b> (also known as <b>Smiltene</b> or <b>Smilt</b>) is a Latvian developer. The username originates from the city of <a target="_blank" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smiltene">Smiltene</a>, Latvia.</p>

        <h2 id="early-life"><span>Early life and career</span></h2>
        <hr class="wiki-hr">

        <p>Smil began programming around 2018-2019. Initially knowing nothing about development, the aspiring developer started with <b>Node.js</b> and <b>Express</b>, eventually transitioning to <b>TypeScript</b>.</p>
        <p>During formal education, Smil expanded into <b>Laravel</b> and <b>C++</b>, broadening the range of technologies and paradigms in the developer's toolkit.</p>

